# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "As long as the Qiskit C API has not yet reached feature parity with its Python API, some components of this package remain exclusive to its Python API, too. This includes the entire circuit library ([`qiskit_fermions.circuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit#module-qiskit_fermions.circuit \"qiskit_fermions.circuit\")) as well as transpiler passes ([`qiskit_fermions.transpiler`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler#module-qiskit_fermions.transpiler \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler\")).\n"
msgstr "Atâta timp cât API-ul C din Qiskit nu a atins încă paritatea de funcționalități cu API-ul său Python, unele componente ale acestui pachet rămân exclusive API-ului Python. Aceasta include întreaga bibliotecă de circuite ([`qiskit_fermions.circuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit#module-qiskit_fermions.circuit \"qiskit_fermions.circuit\")), precum și pașii de transpiler ([`qiskit_fermions.transpiler`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler#module-qiskit_fermions.transpiler \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler\")).\n"

